flowchart LR
	STREAM["The six stream flavors cover only what<br/>the model is emitting right now."]
	RAW["The raw-write tool's normalize: true covers only<br/>content being written."]
	GAP["This flavor covers the gap in between<br/>pre-existing files - git-cloned material - script-created files<br/>anything already on disk that the agent did not just write."]
	STREAM -. "Not disk" .-> GAP
	RAW -. "Not disk" .-> GAP
